  m_Name: InvertParrySymbols
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ValueSO.Core.BoolValueSO
  _description: 'Invert the parry symbols displayed in game (but does not invert
    which input maps to which one).


    So while STAR would normally be left and
    SHELL right, this would set STAR to right and SHELL to left'
